id: camouflaged
name: Camouflaged
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Camouflage (1)'s mark - the Invisible State is its own, read by (2).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Camouflage: Invisible by its first effect - 6(bT) Ki at the start of each turn.
text: >
  Camouflage (2): If you are in the Invisible State due to the first effect of Camouflage, reduce your Ki Points by 6(bT) at the start of your turn.

---

[passive]
